    {
      "id": "claim_0246c3f0ed8e442893cc280dca959af0",
      "statement": "ExecutionEngine.executeTask enforces a fixed preflight governance order: in-memory/durable duplicate and running-state guards, execution_recovery_hold and deep_agent_assurance_hold metadata checks (throwing EXECUTION_RECOVERY_REQUIRED / DEEP_AGENT_ASSURANCE_HOLD), a pending execution-only approval check, a runtime-governance isAllowed check that cancels the task when the assigned agent is quarantined or circuit-breaker-tripped, then CommandRiskClassifier.assessTask, PolicyDecisionService.evaluate, and GovernanceGateService tightening before queueing the task.",
