      "statement": "CommandRiskClassifier screens commands against ordered regex tiers (critical patterns and outside-workspace writes recommend deny; high and medium mutation patterns recommend require_approval; read-only patterns recommend allow) and is fail-closed: an unrecognized command defaults to MEDIUM risk with require_approval, never allow.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/server/src/services/command-risk-classifier.ts#L9-L76",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fa0364e9bade2699a72fe1750269f122a5dae20f959149ac133092435ddc953a:"
        }
      ]
    },
