      "statement": "PolicyDecisionService.evaluate loads enabled approval_policies ordered by priority DESC then created_at DESC, applies the first matching policy, compiles policy match_pattern through ReDoSGuard (dangerous or invalid patterns never match), overrides to deny when the tool is in the policy's blocked_tools, and falls back to the classifier's recommended_decision when no policy matches.",
